 "howToCollect": "Official site https://www.nwscc.or.kr redirects to https://www.nwscc.or.kr:46627/new/main/ (nginx/PHP, EUC-KR pages; on 2026-10-15 the target was port 46627). robots.txt on both origins = \"User-agent: * / Allow: /\" (checked every run). All dated programs of the center and its branches (놀이아띠 toy libraries, 도담도담나눔터 공동육아방) are on one calendar, 교육 및 행사 신청: GET /new/study/care.php?pno=050700&yy=YYYY&mm=M[&page3=N] (plain GET, no cookies). Each page has a month grid (table.__scheTbl, idx in modeChange('idx',...), no times) and a list table.__tblList (20 rows/page; columns 일정 \"YYYY-MM-DD (요일) HH:MM~HH:MM\" | 구분 | 제목 | 신청/정원/대기); pagination is page3=N (the page's goPage3() JS is missing, the GET param works). Empty month row: \"등록된 교육 및 행사 일정이 없습니다.\". We read the current and next month and check that every grid idx appears in the list. Detail (\"일정보기\") is filled by an iframe script: GET /new/study/schedule_proc.php?pno=050700&idx=N returns JS setting info0 구분, info1 일정 (\"YYYY.M.D (요일) ~ YYYY.M.D (요일) / HH:MM~HH:MM\"; 체험행사 uses \"YYYY-MM-DD (요일) HH:MM~HH:MM\"), info2 조회수 (our requests probably count as views), info3 제목, info3_max 교육정원 (\"12명\"), info3_fee 교육비 (\"무료\"), info3_2_1 신청기간 (\"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM ~ YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\"; applyStart/End keep only the dates as written, an end of \"00:00\" means the period closes at the start of that day), info4 body HTML (usually empty or a poster image; target/age/venue details are only in the images, not read), info5 신청인원. No login needed to view; applying (\"온라인 신청하기\") alerts \"회원만 신청할 수 있습니다.\" and 도담도담나눔터 예약 (/new/raise/time4.php) redirects to login, so neither is used. Stable public link per program: /new/study/care.php?main=Y&mainv={idx}&mainx=ok&yy=YYYY&mm=M (opens the detail view; used as url/ID). Dates on the site carry the year, no inference needed. Each session is its own row/idx (weekly series are separate rows); rows dated before today are still opened once to catch multi-day ranges. statusText is null: the 마감/대기 button label set by the detail script targets an element (btnOk02) that does not exist on the page, so no status is shown to users; applied/capacity come from 신청인원/교육정원 (list 신청/정원/대기 as fallback; 정원 0 → null). target is null unless the body text has a \"대상: ...\" line; ageTags only from explicit words (구분 부모교육 → parent; 부모-자녀/가족 → family; [영아]/[유아] or target wording → infant/preschool; parent-only lectures get no child-age tags). facility = branch named in the title prefix ([도담도담나눔터] / [놀이아띠] + 지점) else the center; the actual room is not stated, so plain \"도담도담나눔터\" has no address. Addresses are copied from the 오시는 길 pages (/new/center/location*.html). Excluded: 구분 교사교육 (보육교직원) and 평가제 (어린이집); 구분 도담도담나눔터 = \"(기관)\" 공동육아방 time slots for daycare centers; [공통부모교육] 부모-자녀체험활동/찾아가는 공통부모교육 whose body says daycare centers apply with a 기관아이디 (capacity 1 = one daycare); 체험행사 unless the text says (개인)/가족/부모/자녀 (e.g. \"[문화공연] 어린이 소방안전교육\" was booked by 어린이집); services [놀이아띠]장난감병원 (toy repair slots) and [백.돌.이] 백일 돌상 포토존 (photo-zone rental slots); 장난감 대여/토이붕붕 and the toy catalogue (/new/raise/dab3.php). Scope: programEnd >= collectedAt and programStart within 60 days.",
